WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:08.680 --> 00:00:10.060
What’s good playas?

00:00:10.060 --> 00:00:12.580
This week we chiefin some of dat Middle Earth scroll

00:00:12.580 --> 00:00:14.600
with The Hobbit by J.R.R. Tolkien.

00:00:18.120 --> 00:00:22.340
Down in the hood of Bag End lives a
hobbit by the name of Bilbo Baggins.

00:00:22.340 --> 00:00:27.900
Now hobbits be little shorties that don’t like to do nothin but keep it chill and get they grub on.

00:00:27.900 --> 00:00:34.080
One day, some nappy wizard name of Gandalf
drops in at his crib rollin 13 dwarves deep.

00:00:34.460 --> 00:00:38.820
Gandalf and the head dwarf, Thorin, ask if
Bilbo wanna go on an adventure.

00:00:38.820 --> 00:00:43.260
Turns out some punk ass dragon
named Smaug dun boosted all dem dwarves' bling

00:00:43.260 --> 00:00:46.020
and be shackin on their turf
over at the Lonely Mountain.

00:00:46.020 --> 00:00:49.340
So they bout to go lay a whoop on that dragon,
know what I mean?

00:00:49.340 --> 00:00:54.680
But Bilbo don’t wanna do sh*t except stay home, smoke some trees, and take it easy.

00:00:54.680 --> 00:00:58.399
So Gandalf and his boys
have ta get that fool’s ass in gear.

00:00:58.399 --> 00:01:02.639
Now after scrappin with some weak-ass
trolls and chillin with some pointy- eared playas,

00:01:02.640 --> 00:01:05.240
Bilbo and his peeps roll up to the Misty Mountains,

00:01:05.240 --> 00:01:09.920
where some Goblins start beefin with his boys, making everyone scatter across the mountain.

00:01:09.920 --> 00:01:13.940
Lost in the tunnels, Bilbo finds a
phat ring just chillin on the ground.

00:01:13.940 --> 00:01:17.380
Then he peeps some chanky scrub named Gollum creepin on his sh*t.

00:01:17.380 --> 00:01:18.820
After serving this fool up,

00:01:18.820 --> 00:01:24.240
Bilbo uses the ring’s invisibility power to escape the tunnels and meet back up with his crew.

00:01:24.240 --> 00:01:29.100
Seeing how Bilbo be struttin like a boss,
them dwarves be giving him mad respect.

00:01:29.160 --> 00:01:33.560
Then all dem playas arrive at the
Lonley Mountain where Smaug be chillin with his stash.

00:01:33.560 --> 00:01:38.560
Bilbo puts on the ring, sneaks into the dragon’s lair,
and boosts some of his ice.

00:01:38.560 --> 00:01:43.300
When Smaug realize that somebody
be gankin his swag, he goes hyphy in this bitch

00:01:43.300 --> 00:01:48.600
and starts tearing up the nearby towns where he gets his sh*t wrecked by some playa named Bard.

00:01:48.600 --> 00:01:51.260
Now that Smaug be dead, them humans say

00:01:51.260 --> 00:01:55.460
“Yo. Since the dragon jacked up our crib,
 we want some o dat cheddar.”

00:01:55.460 --> 00:01:59.660
But Thorin be all like “Naw blood. I ain’t givin y'all sh*t.”

00:01:59.660 --> 00:02:03.560
So them homies bout to war with the
dwarves when Gandalf drops in and says

00:02:03.560 --> 00:02:07.380
“Break yoself fool! Wargs and goblins
bout to brawl up in here!”

00:02:07.380 --> 00:02:12.520
So all them playas -men, elves, and dwarves- strap up and wreck them haters.

00:02:12.520 --> 00:02:15.020
But in the end, Thorin gets shanked.

00:02:15.020 --> 00:02:19.920
On his death bed, Thorin goes out like a G and admits to Bilbo that he been actin a fool.

00:02:19.920 --> 00:02:24.950
Then Bilbo takes only the cash he
can carry, and finds his way home back to Bag End.

00:02:24.960 --> 00:02:27.660
There and Back Again, ya heard?

00:02:31.340 --> 00:02:34.820
At the beginning of this book,
Bilbo be actin like a little ol bitch

00:02:34.820 --> 00:02:39.920
cuz he ain’t got the balls to get off his hairy ass and get his adventure on. I’m just sayin.

00:02:39.920 --> 00:02:44.620
But as things start gettin real, Bilbo ups
his game and starts keepin it gangsta.

00:02:44.620 --> 00:02:50.220
Like when he saves the dwarves from them crusty-ass spiders, he not only clockin some mad courage,

00:02:50.220 --> 00:02:54.360
but he straight up sacrificing
himself to draw them spiders away from his boys.

00:02:54.360 --> 00:02:58.680
So by the end, shorty don’t WANNA
be a thug, he straight-up IS one.

00:02:58.680 --> 00:03:04.320
Look, if you wanna get this sh*t all the way turnt up, you best recognize the importance of “Dragon Sickness.”

00:03:04.320 --> 00:03:08.760
A term Tolkien using to describe
Smaug’s obsession with dat phat cash.

00:03:08.760 --> 00:03:11.620
When Bilbo and his posse
roll up to the Lonely Mountain,

00:03:11.620 --> 00:03:15.840
they find that the all dat once green land
 is now all busted up.

00:03:15.840 --> 00:03:18.420
But it ain’t all about the physical aspect, my man.

00:03:18.420 --> 00:03:24.020
Nah, this here detail serves as a metaphor for the destructive nature of greed, homeboy.

00:03:24.140 --> 00:03:27.859
In fact, all dem homies get
a little taste of dragon sickness.

00:03:27.859 --> 00:03:30.959
For example, Thorin be sippin too much of that haterade

00:03:30.960 --> 00:03:34.240
when dem elves ask him
for some cash to rebuild their crib.

00:03:34.240 --> 00:03:38.980
So when big daddy dwarf gets merced in the end, he ain’t got nobody to blame but himself.

00:03:38.980 --> 00:03:43.611
If you think this idea of greed and self-destruction
only apply to the dragon and Thorin,

00:03:43.620 --> 00:03:45.600
you just ain’t doin it big, son.

00:03:45.600 --> 00:03:50.100
When dem trolls get their asses turned to stone, it ain’t because Gandalf whooping them.

00:03:50.100 --> 00:03:55.940
Nah, blood. It’s the trolls’ tendency to fight amongst themselves that allows Gandalf to bust em up.

00:03:55.940 --> 00:03:59.220
So on the real, them trolls are undone by they own evil.

00:03:59.220 --> 00:04:01.640
And if you wanna keep it triple OG up in here,

00:04:01.640 --> 00:04:07.620
you best peep the thematic connections between this book and “The Ring Cycle” by my man Richard Wagner.

00:04:07.620 --> 00:04:09.580
Consider these two quotes, son.

00:04:20.700 --> 00:04:25.240
At the end of The Hobbit, that fool
Thorin finally realizes that stackin phat cash

00:04:25.240 --> 00:04:28.120
means you droppin other values
like courage and wisdom.

00:04:28.120 --> 00:04:34.360
Yet, in Das Rheingold, my boy Richie Dub sayin that you can only make bank if you drop dem values first.

00:04:34.360 --> 00:04:39.300
It’s like they preachin the same cold truth, 
cept backwards. Naw mean?

00:04:39.300 --> 00:04:42.860
Hey thanks for tunin in, blood.
